# ── Build request ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^maker has valid data for PortfolioReassignment event$"
    Given build json request from current scenario with trade id from stored variable 'createdTradeId' as user 'maker@example.com'

@When "^maker has invalid data for PortfolioReassignment event$"
    Given build json request from current scenario with trade id from stored variable 'createdTradeId' as user 'maker@example.com'

# ── Make api call ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^performs the PortfolioReassignment event via api$"
    When post to path '/trades/trigger-event'
    And attach the response body to the report


# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Then "^the PortfolioReassignment event is executed successfully$"
    Then the 'portfolioReassignment' should be 'executed' successfully

@Then "^the PortfolioReassignment event is rejected with a validation error$"
    Then failed to 'execute' 'PortfolioReassignment'
